567
00:23:58,500 --> 00:24:01,500
Of course, Clos3D at our academy,

568
00:24:01,500 --> 00:24:03,500
yes, it starts very much off

569
00:24:03,500 --> 00:24:05,500
where you saw kind of expression of design,

