573
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:14,500
And all the garments that you saw

574
00:24:14,500 --> 00:24:17,500
and kind of the statues in this gallery space,

575
00:24:17,500 --> 00:24:19,500
they were all created in Clos3D,

576
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:21,500
