583
00:24:37,500 --> 00:24:39,500
And at WDKA, we are in this together.

584
00:24:39,500 --> 00:24:42,500
So in our Erasmus project,

585
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:44,500
Me, You, Us, the research project,

586
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:46,500
